{"E:\\videos\\clyde6\\wt\\vlog\\clyde6\\voz\\b000_t2.wav": {"text": "Never buy breakfast sausage again. Look at this little roll from the store. One pound. Five dollars and forty-nine cents. And now look at this pork shoulder right here. Eight pounds. Seventeen dollars. That shoulder is going to make you more sausage than eight of those rolls. And it is going to taste like the sausage your granddaddy ate. and you do not need a grinder, a stuffer, or one single machine. Just a knife, a bowl, and a cold morning. Last fall my neighbor Darlene came by the smokehouse with a roll of the store kind in her hand. She said, Clyde, I fry this every Saturday and it comes out gray. It sits in a puddle of grease and it falls apart when I flip it. And I said, friend, that is not your fault. That is what happens when somebody grinds it warm, salts it heavy, and sells you mostly water and fat. I chopped her a pound by hand, right here on this block.", "words": [{"w": " Never", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.3}, {"w": " buy", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.7}, {"w": " breakfast", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.22}, {"w": " sausage", "s": 1.22, "e": 1.76}, {"w": " again.", "s": 1.76, "e": 2.76}, {"w": " Look", "s": 3.56, "e": 3.72}, {"w": " at", "s": 3.72, "e": 3.84}, {"w": " this", "s": 3.84, "e": 4.04}, {"w": " little", "s": 4.04, "e": 4.32}, {"w": " roll", "s": 4.32, "e": 4.72}, {"w": " from", "s": 4.72, "e": 4.98}, {"w": " the", "s": 4.98, "e": 5.16}, {"w": " store.", "s": 5.16, "e": 5.56}, {"w": " One", "s": 6.64, "e": 6.86}, {"w": " pound.", "s": 6.86, "e": 7.28}, {"w": " Five", "s": 8.52, "e": 8.82}, {"w": " dollars", "s": 8.82, "e": 9.24}, {"w": " and", "s": 9.24, "e": 9.48}, {"w": " forty-nine", "s": 9.48, "e": 10.16}, {"w": " cents.", "s": 10.16, "e": 11.16}, {"w": " And", "s": 11.9, "e": 12.04}, {"w": " now", "s": 12.04, "e": 12.2}, {"w": " look", "s": 12.2, "e": 12.44}, {"w": " at", "s": 12.44, "e": 12.56}, {"w": " this", "s": 12.56, "e": 12.74}, {"w": " pork", "s": 12.74, "e": 13.1}, {"w": " shoulder", "s": 13.1,